ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/1.5.md:310:After1.4+1.5+3.1, the functional path can be tested before Phase 4 teacher/Phase 5 BC. Native L1/L2 are present, but smoke assertions for integrated truncation/raw-bank evaluation, eval seeds and failure status additionally require the relevant3.2/3.3/L7 edits or must be reported as failed/pending. Do not silently declare them covered merely because three tasks merged. Existing3.6 alarm must be wired for Kaggriculture. This is a functional smoke, no learning/throughput/Phase 6 qualification claim.
