cookbook/references/kaggriculture-bc-trainer-warm-starts-ppo-from-the-held-out-best.md:3:title: "Kaggriculture BC trainer warm-starts PPO from the held-out best"
cookbook/references/kaggriculture-bc-trainer-warm-starts-ppo-from-the-held-out-best.md:4:description: "Task 5.2 trainer script: scripts/train_bc.py trains the registered KaggricultureTransformer on teacher-forced replay NLL plus a winner cross-entropy critic target from raw final banks, through Isaiah's factory, optimizer, BF16 autocast, cuBLAS-only compile and DDP seams. It reads the refreshed 5.1 kaggriculture-bc-shard-v1 format into rank-partitioned host memory, keeps the best checkpoint by held-out NLL in run_ppo's exact schema and stops after sustained non-improvement (L9). CPU-tested with synthetic shards; no GPU, DDP, compile, real-data or W&B execution yet."
