ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/4-teacher.md:246:Shared test helpers (`_tiny`, `_base_case`, `_replay_case`, `_map_obs`, `_cat_obs`, `_take_obs`, `_take_actions`) move from `tests/kaggriculture/test_model_heads.py` to `tests/kaggriculture/helpers.py` in 4.1's first commit (a refactor; the heads tests keep passing unchanged in behavior). A segment-major batch is `_map_obs(obs, lambda t: t.reshape(N, T, *t.shape[1:]))` over `make_obs(envs=N*T, ...)`, with the same reshape for actions.
