Mutation testing is exposing gaps in the new tests: removing several input guards leaves the BC suite green, and reversing the supervised loss sign still passes the “loss decreases” test. I’m recording these separately from the implementation defects so the verdict distinguishes faulty behavior from missing test coverage.

